===Strategy===

Stronger than a bear, but very slow - about 2nd walking speed. Has a lot of armor (200/400), high piercing weapons (like [[Boar Spear]] or unarmed combat) are more effective than usual. It's a good idea to stack a lot IP and deal a lot of openings before it starts to fight back.

